Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to bring out my ultimate\Nmonster! Huh! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to my Guardian Dreadside!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you holding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.47,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A card that forces you to take\Na closer look at yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Underworld Circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth does that do? Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.65,0:00:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to take some responsibility\Nfor what you've done, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Underworld Circle, activate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.61,0:00:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's gone. Yes,\Nand so is mine now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.65,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,witness your true darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.83,0:00:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope when the smoke clears,\Nit's the Pharaoh that's standing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:00:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.17,0:02:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaohs trapped in\Nthere with that creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How did this happen? I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He played that Underworld Circle card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this another vision generated\Nby the seal of Obelisk?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.19,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.05,0:02:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Underworld Circle lets us\Nbring back monsters we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I've somehow been\Ntransported to the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.95,0:02:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This wasn't part of my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Raphael. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.89,0:02:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't, but I\Nknow exactly where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.45,0:03:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.97,0:03:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's all starting to make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.59,0:03:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts once took me here\Nto expose me to the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, this is a vision from your past?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Always remember, my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.65,0:03:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sad fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But the sooner you learn that,\Nthe sooner you can start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the accident, your family\Nhas forgotten all about you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem to have moved on. And\Nyou should as well. Just let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, come back
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent you here so you can bury\Nyour past and leave it behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,for it's all over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And today is the day\Nyou begin your new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do as I say and\Nthe pain will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.71,0:04:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your family now, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.63,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,However, unlike your previous\Nloved ones, I won't abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.63,0:05:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one final task\Nyou need to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You must tunnel your way into the\Nground and unearth your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the anger inside to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the pain of your past, and you'll\Nfind the tools to rebuild your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength you seek is in your grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now dig, and don't stop till you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.85,0:05:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the darkness consume you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael, tell me what is it that\Ndarts forced you to uncover that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Iathos?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.43,0:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Embrace your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now activate that card, and your\Ntransformation will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fight against it, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow the seal of\NOricalcos to set you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The events that came\Nbefore are meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You have been reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a new guardian now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the custodian of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Dread Scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature was formed from the rage\Nwithin your heart, my young friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, you are forever bonded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.69,0:07:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your journey is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, now do you understand\Nthe brilliance of Master Darts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows exactly how the world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And more importantly,\Nhe knows how to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:08:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're so loyal to this Darts, then why\Ndo you deliberately disobey him, Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.61,0:08:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He told you to let go of the past,\Nyet you stay loyal to your guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.13,0:08:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.87,0:08:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He was trying to help me move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.75,0:08:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts is a madman, and the only\Nperson he's helping is himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,by convincing you to hate the world\Nand abandon everything you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Darts gave me the\Npower I needed to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time to unleash it on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guardian Dread Scythe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.79,0:08:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The smoke cleared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Pharaoh alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,my underworld circle magic card\Nshould have destroyed every single
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,monster on the field it also\Nforces us to remove every monster
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,card from our decks for the\Nrest of the game after that the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:09:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,only creatures we're allowed to\Nuse are the ones in our graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why my dark magician\Ngirl is gone now so why is your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,dread sight still on the field By\Neliminating a card from my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,my Guardian Dread Scythe is able\Nto automatically revive itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.89,0:09:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean my monster's got a\Nmind of its own. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.43,0:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was created to be indestructible,\Nso not even I can get rid of it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the Pharaoh can't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the effect of my magic card,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.61,0:09:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I have access to every monster\Nin my card graveyard now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.35,0:09:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But your graveyard is off-limits\Nthanks to your Dread Sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.11,0:09:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The monsters I sacrificed are\Ngone, and I don't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one creature I need now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Darts gave him that beast to\Nfeed the darkness in his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So perhaps if I destroy\Nit, I can set Raphael free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of Underworld Circle lets\Nme bring back my Dark Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have a shot after all. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,now that he can play cards from his\Ngraveyard He should be able to start
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,kicking some butt I place this face down\NAnd that ends my turn You're done, Pharaoh
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not as long as my magic cards in play It\Nlets me bring back my Jax Knight as well
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome. He can summon\Nmonsters on his opponent's turn. You
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,don't scare me Your pathetic\Nmonsters are still no match for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreadside, attack as Dark Magician now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.99,0:10:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate zero gravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.63,0:10:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the power of my trap card,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,every monster on the field in attack mode\Nautomatically switches to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he just stopped that zombie\Nthing dead in its tracks, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.13,0:11:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my trap, Spirit Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This card switches my Guardian\NDread Sight back into attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it can pick up where it left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.69,0:11:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael destroyed two\Nof his monsters at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.05,0:11:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.35,0:11:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And my magic card allows me to\Nbring back my Dark Magician Girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NAltar of Restoration!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.57,0:11:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,By discarding two cards from my deck,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can rescue another\Nmonster from my graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And the card I choose is Eye of Timaeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Tamias and Dark Magician\NGirl, merge together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks he can use his new dragon's\Nspecial effect to destroy my guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Pharaoh,\Nlet's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Magician Girl, the Dragon\NKnight, destroy his dread sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that's the end\Nof that freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't listen very well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Dread Scythe\Nis indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew that monster could revive\Nitself, so why did he attack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I place this face down and end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi better not let this\Nchump defeat him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who deserves that glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using my Underworld Circle card\Nto bring back my Queen's Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.73,0:13:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just face it, your strategy's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By discarding one card, I can activate\Nthe Oricanko Sword of Sealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.23,0:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's gonna leave a\Nmark, wouldn't you say, Timaeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Dread Scythe, attack Dark\NMagician Girl, the Dragon Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.91,0:13:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you be standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've activated my reduction barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.67,0:14:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,which means the number of life points\NI lose is reduced to ten percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he's only got\Nten life points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.10,0:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's still on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fight till my last point is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a promise, Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I crush you, your soul\Nwill belong to Master Darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been brainwashed,\Nblinded by your own darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But I believe there's\Nstill good inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And I plan to bring it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.11,0:14:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With this move, first I'll\Nuse the magic of Underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.97,0:14:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle To bring my Big Shield\NGardener back to the field
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate my Pot of\NGreed. This lets me draw two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent, that's just the\Ncard I've been waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.93,0:14:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to face what you did When you\Nbetrayed your heart For now I activate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card Spiderweb, which lets\Nme use a card from your graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.41,0:15:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm using my spiderweb to bring\Nback your Monster Reborn card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.29,0:15:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm planning on using it to save you\Nby setting you free from the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.03,0:15:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I use Monster Reborn to revive a creature\Nthat once saved your life and that you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,in turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,desert it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Iatos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do with that card?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully win.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.15,0:15:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I can only accomplish\Nthis with your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the Claw of Hermos!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joey, check it out, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He just summoned your boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.47,0:16:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And now Hermos and Queen's Knights\Ncombine together to form Goddess Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,that doubles the attack points of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.77,0:16:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,guardian eatos and since eatos has been
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.81,0:16:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,removed from your graveyard your
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.81,0:16:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,dread scythe gets weaker what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.97,0:16:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,up to our monsters are even now so\Nif you attack they're both destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.53,0:16:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but mine comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a few more surprises planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Iatos, attack his Dread Scythe now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the special\Nability of my Goddess Bone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every time your Dread Scythe\Nrevives itself, Iatos can attack again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:17:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, with each\Nattack, you lose another card!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If Raphael runs out of cards,\Nhis monster can't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.65,0:17:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The dark flame of your\Ndreadsight is now extinguished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned your back on your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.13,0:17:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At one time, they meant the world to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But then darts convinced you to abandon\Neverything that was important to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.47,0:17:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He fed you lies about your\Nfamily and fueled your rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.99,0:17:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And in a moment of weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.67,0:17:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you allowed your heart to become consumed\Nby the dark magic of the Orycalcos.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.41,0:17:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I could tell the real you was\Nstill in there fighting to break free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I knew what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Force you to face the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one problem\Nwith your plan, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:18:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Orycalcos still needs\Nto capture one of our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say we finish\Nthis off and see who goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.45,0:18:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late. My move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the power of Underworld\NCircle to bring back my Guardian Grawr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NSoul Charge Magic Card,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,allowing me to summon even more\Nmonsters from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's four monsters! Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,any monster that's summoned by using\NSoul Charge can't attack for one turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.67,0:18:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.93,0:18:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My graveyard is completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My guardians are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Each monster I brought back from\Nthe grave cost me 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Rafael.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made the correct choice, Rafael.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness has lifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.51,0:19:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Rafael!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a vision of\Nwhat's inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone I turn my back on is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And they'll always be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:19:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the seal is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it usually put on\Na big green laser show?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and it usually\Ntakes someone's soul, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so you're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost. I have a theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.85,0:20:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of Ori Kalkos is powered by the\Ndarkness within the person who plays it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.19,0:20:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But Raphael was able to\Nconquer that darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So my soul was spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.71,0:20:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.05,0:20:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.99,0:20:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's much worse than that.
